{"id":"wb-1-95","name":"萨迦寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"萨迦寺","text":"萨迦寺（藏语：ས་སྐྱ་དགོན།，威利转写：Sa skya dGon，藏语拼音：Sa'gya Gön），地点位于中国西藏自治区日喀则市萨迦县本波山下，是一座藏传佛教萨迦派寺院，也是萨迦派的主寺。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%90%A8%E8%BF%A6%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94817373,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94817373","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bde03933105028b896cb5d8e.jpg","title":"TIB-sakya-nordkloster.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:TIB-sakya-nordkloster.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/TIB-sakya-nordkloster.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Bgabel","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Nordkloster Sakya","width":320,"height":212}}